# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything committed here is visible to anyone,
# and stays visible in the history even after it is deleted. Keep internal
# documents and anything with a credential in it out of the repo entirely.
#
# Note: site content lives in _content/, images/, css/, js/ and admin/ — nothing
# below may match those, or the published site breaks.

# --- Agent + editor working files ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Internal Gainly documents (not site content) ---
# Put any future strategy, planning or client-internal document in _internal/
# and it is ignored automatically.
_internal/
MASTER_STRATEGY.md
REDESIGN_PLAN.md
ISSUE_*.md
TALLY_*.md
Ambleside-Website-Guide.pdf

# --- Credentials: never commit any of these ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
secrets*.yml

# --- Build + dependency output ---
node_modules/
.netlify/
*.log

# --- Scratch, backup and OS junk ---
/*.py
*.bak
*.orig
*~
index (*).html
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
